      "releaseNotes": "What’s New in Cubasis 3.8.5 \nThis update brings 40+ improvements and refinements for an even smoother music production experience. \n\nFor the full list of changes, visit: https://steinberg.net/cubasisforum. \n\nIf you enjoy Cubasis, please support us by rating the app in the App Store!",
